# Insta360 Bridge — Walkthrough

## Phase 1: Cleanup
Removed all unused components: `server/`, `sdks/`, `shared/`, `web-companion/`, `old_frontend/`, `node_modules/`, `build/`, `recordings/`, scripts, and 19 doc files. Project now only contains `android-companion/` and SDK reference dirs.

## Phase 2: Saved Videos Gallery Page
Added **🎬 Saved Videos** page to the hamburger menu. Shows recording cards with date, duration, start/stop coordinates, and settings chips. Auto-loads when navigated to.

**Files:** [index.html](file:///c:/Users/SreejaSaiLachannagar/Desktop/insta360-camera-operating-bridge/fake-camera-stream/android-companion/app/src/main/assets/www/index.html), [styles.css](file:///c:/Users/SreejaSaiLachannagar/Desktop/insta360-camera-operating-bridge/fake-camera-stream/android-companion/app/src/main/assets/www/styles.css), [app.js](file:///c:/Users/SreejaSaiLachannagar/Desktop/insta360-camera-operating-bridge/fake-camera-stream/android-companion/app/src/main/assets/www/app.js)

## Export Pipeline

### Architecture
```
Recording Stops → onCaptureFinish() stores file paths
       ↓
Auto-export triggered → WebAppInterface.exportRecording(id)
       ↓
VideoExporter.exportBothResolutions()
       ↓
├── 8K Export (7680×3840, 30fps, 100Mbps, H264, MP4)
│   ├── FlowState Stabilization ✅
│   ├── Dynamic Stitching ✅
│   ├── Chromatic Calibration ✅
│   └── Image Fusion ✅
└── 1080P Export (1920×960, 30fps, 20Mbps, H264, MP4)
    └── Same settings as 8K
       ↓
Progress → JS callback → Layout log
Success → Toast notification
Output → /Android/data/com.example.insta360bridge/files/Movies/Insta360Bridge/
```

### Files Created/Modified

#### [NEW] [VideoExporter.kt](file:///c:/Users/SreejaSaiLachannagar/Desktop/insta360-camera-operating-bridge/fake-camera-stream/android-companion/app/src/main/java/com/example/insta360bridge/VideoExporter.kt)
Uses exact same SDK patterns as the official demo ([ExportVideoParamsBuilder](file:///c:/Users/SreejaSaiLachannagar/Desktop/insta360-camera-operating-bridge/fake-camera-stream/sdk_demo_1.9.4/sdkdemo2/app/src/main/java/com/arashivision/sdk/demo/ui/play/WorkPlayViewModel.kt#168-196), `ExportUtils.exportVideo`, `IExportCallback`). Settings:
- `stabType = InstaStabType.STAB_TYPE_AUTO` (FlowState)
- `isDynamicStitch = true`
- `isDePurpleFilterOn = true` (Chromatic Calibration)
- `isImageFusion = true` (Lens Stitching)
- `exportMode = ExportMode.PANORAMA`

